edge-addition-planarity-suite
------------------------------------------
The primary purpose of this repository is to provide implementations of the
edge addition planar graph embedding algorithm and related algorithms,
including a planar graph drawing method, an isolator for a minimal subgraph
obstructing planarity in non-planar graphs, outerplanar graph embedder and
obstruction isolator algorithms, and tester/isolator algorithms for subgraphs
homeomorphic to K2,3, K4, and K3,3. The C implementations in this repository
are the reference implementations of algorithms.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libplanarity-devel-5.1.0.0-1bl1
  libplanarity4-5.1.0.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/graph-algorithms/edge-addition-planarity-suite

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/graph-algorithms/edge-addition-planarity-suite/archive/refs/tags/Version_5.1.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack edge-addition-planarity-suite-5.1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./edge-addition-planarity-suite-5.1.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/edge-addition-planarity-suite-5.1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/edge-addition-planarity-suite-5.1.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libplanarity4-5.1.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libplanarity-devel-5.1.0.0-X.tar.xz

